# Build context for frontend/Dockerfile (the repository root). Allow-list: the site needs only the
# frontend source, the workshop modules and the docs. Everything else (secrets, bundles, Python
# virtualenvs, model files) never enters the context.
*
!frontend
!workshop
!docs
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/out
frontend/next-env.d.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
